Completion generation is an early command path and should not initialize the
installer or registry.

```console
$ utoo completions bash
_utoo() {
...
            utoo,install)
                cmd="utoo__install"
...

```

If no shell is provided and auto-detection fails, completions exits with a usage
error code.

```console
$ SHELL=/bin/definitely-not-a-shell utoo completions
? 2
Could not detect shell. Usage: utoo completions <bash|zsh|fish|powershell|elvish>

```
